{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d7cbeb62d3b8fe4308a4b4de71c8eddb4025d61248221d0c8df9c3282b01f404", "ja": "（紗代子のブログが、ファンの人達に好評だ。\nサンタとアイドルは似ている、か……）", "zh": "（纱代子的部落格大受粉丝的好评。\n圣诞老人与偶像很相似，是吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "a46bfb6a397a36609c7936e79e3116cc322131c4bcb42609dbf2eba6b54daec9", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n你辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a4da46e44467128fd4735560b525fee423dbcc27d4cc0db153ba204b8c7b7624", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。ブログ読んだよ。\nなかなか夢のある内容だったな。", "zh": "你也辛苦了，纱代子。\n我看过部落格啰，内容充满梦想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1003_p", "source_sha256": "685f7e3cbc0cc2437194f80226b7960748294e2fafbaea8e533b5d40a1d3cd14", "ja": "なんだか俺まで、紗代子から\nクリスマスプレゼントをもらったような気がしたよ。", "zh": "总觉得好像连我也收到\n纱代子送的圣诞礼物了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "c9e9b1c88a9afe948d57d57df23a07140ae12bcc5e35f4f1af54f336c39e8948", "ja": "ふふっ、本当ですか？　自分では、ちょっと\n子供っぽいかなと思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，真的吗？\n我自己倒是觉得写得有些幼稚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1005_p", "source_sha256": "69040a4f83ae37abb73724b71b9cf0d067705f4e0b341a17d3631588c4c01a13", "ja": "そんなことないよ。あのブログを読んで、みんな\nますます紗代子を好きになったんじゃないかな？", "zh": "不会啊？粉丝们看到那篇部落格文章，\n应该会更喜欢纱代子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "1ab9c6bd423eaa6faac7677444023007539e8198356fa27ee12e046eb6301494", "ja": "そうですか？　でもファンのみんなに\nよろこんでもらえたなら、よかったです！", "zh": "会吗？但如果能让粉丝们开心，\n那就太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "faa8fcd822680b89957bc7245efefd1ca42efa27afa87470deb869298ffbd0db", "ja": "この衣装を着てみて、改めて思ったんです。\nアイドルの仕事って、サンタと同じなのかも、って。", "zh": "穿上这套服装后我又重新认识到，\n偶像的工作也许跟圣诞老人很像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "72ca48a640d381c3168440a9b24cee5e84caa2f47d28550edc0a007ef851961d", "ja": "私が自分で思っている以上に、私たちのことを\n待ってくれてる人がいるんじゃないかって。", "zh": "等待着我们出现的人，\n说不定比我自己想像的还要多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1009_p", "source_sha256": "daeae52c8c8f2c9b0161d7f4645c761d300ec6262f037eaf2ad7c91f752ad4a9", "ja": "紗代子……。", "zh": "纱代子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "db90b38314bdecdbc07848fd9d3062b4180731995536d5038848815afcc38833", "ja": "信じて待ってくれている人たちに夢を届ける。\n私たちなら、それができると思うんです！", "zh": "为信任并等待着我们的人们送上梦想，\n我认为我们一定办得到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1011_p", "source_sha256": "554f969cb08e184cd4e36926263cb2824aa703eb3bb7a6e68e08007e8ebf144d", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。\n紗代子ならきっと、本物のサンタになれるよ。", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n纱代子一定能成为真正的圣诞老人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "077e0d7d9de09936290802cdb02b5379519211d0399ba11dfbb9e6c925819e9e", "ja": "はい！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}！", "zh": "是！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "a4517b09b5f3030e87b9a1b6c61e371ee8e6061a3514b8fb4781c8e9a4ccf18b", "ja": "でも本物のサンタになるなら、\n今よりもっと努力しないと、ですよね！", "zh": "不过要成为真正的圣诞老人，\n就必须比以往付出更多努力，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "3930cb0501b4b5f5b1207a1c38b40e3326d388171fb765e5fe922bc7fc5c68b5", "ja": "だってたった一晩で、世界中の子供たちに贈り物を\nするなんて……並大抵の努力じゃないと思うんです。", "zh": "毕竟一个晚上就得将礼物送给全世界的小朋友……\n所需要的努力一定非比寻常。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c4432c78ba90c4b1c5de86c89fa0f63904a22af65b693215612b6c6c5e17265e", "ja": "そ、そうかもしれないな。\n言われてみれば、かなり大変そうだ……。", "zh": "或、或许是吧。\n经你这么一说，的确挺辛苦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "1122d8413cc3cc1597f5f776b92819d75fabbfb7175067ebea1064eaaff5b499", "ja": "わかりました！　完璧なサンタを目指して、\nさっそくレッスンですね！", "zh": "好的！为了成为完美的圣诞老人，\n我马上开始训练！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "1bf27a37fbf2acd250aaa34bd3e7ff7d01de59576c651ac483e329f0ab525141", "ja": "一晩で、できるだけたくさんの人に\n夢を届けられるよう、精いっぱいがんばります！", "zh": "我会尽全力加油，\n尽可能在一个晚上让更多的人收到梦想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c3b8e3d041aafa652eae080cd625cb4c5b7ec52549bf79630bdff930e051c46f", "ja": "ははは、その意気だ。\n世界中で愛されるサンタアイドル目指して、頑張ろう！", "zh": "哈哈哈，这样就对了。\n努力成为受全世界喜爱的圣诞偶像吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "29b807bdb954b4b9a12537d1d5fd0a1b43fbc7e4892d07fa6406c306472b3589", "ja": "はい！\n……あ、でも、それってつまり……。", "zh": "好的！\n……啊，不过，这也就是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "2f8313f2fcba70b262fa505846ec2b879284c8c2368281d66526cf8998c509fd", "ja": "{$P$}が、\n私たちのトナカイ……ってことでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}是\n我们的驯鹿……对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1021_p", "source_sha256": "38530b4984010f5d6c1408d510125e06c4f7d93b136563f687325e5b7707445b", "ja": "トナカイか、確かに……。\nじゃあ、赤い鼻でも付けて来ようかな。", "zh": "驯鹿吗？的确……\n那么，我去找个红鼻子戴着吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "8f0c36e8e49f11be0e23319a1558aded0c7f39bce885ba7d56fe87bc2ead19a5", "ja": "ええっ！？\nあ、赤い鼻ですか……？", "zh": "什么！？\n红、红鼻子吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0094_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "bd5bdfeaa201c073d72154b7a3997badd660ba0ac3189ae1fae5655288f79f33", "ja": "あ……でも、{$P$}なら、\nもしかしたら似合うかも……？　うん……。", "zh": "啊……不过，如果由{$P$}来戴，\n也许挺适合的……？嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
